      "id": "claim_adb8f4f37b6044e8bf84c03ce5c901c1",
      "statement": "getClient(clientId, password) reads the alias client.<clientId> directly from the keystore with a caller-supplied password and returns raw encoded bytes; it is not referenced by any production source, so the client.* alias family is a dormant API.",
